1
00:00:00,666 --> 00:00:01,791
As you all know,

2
00:00:01,791 --> 00:00:05,041
my eldest son Severin has wasted these years.

3
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:10,166
He spends his days in
the mines, mixing with commoners.

4
00:00:12,083 --> 00:00:14,250
My younger son Redmond, however,

5
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:17,000
has been diligently managing the family affairs.

6
00:00:17,041 --> 00:00:18,291
Thanks to him,

7
00:00:18,291 --> 00:00:21,000
House Carter
has grown stronger every day.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,750
Even though Severin has been idle,

9
00:00:25,750 --> 00:00:27,250
he is my eldest son.

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,083
As their father, I cannot choose between them.

11
00:00:30,083 --> 00:00:32,166
So I must ask you
all to vote and decide.

12
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,500
Whichever one you choose,

13
00:00:35,083 --> 00:00:37,500
I will accept it without
complaint as head of House Carter.

14
00:00:40,125 --> 00:00:44,666
Truly worthy of our lord, always so fair and thoughtful.

15
00:00:45,583 --> 00:00:49,333
Severin may be the eldest, but
 in terms of ability,

16
00:00:49,375 --> 00:00:51,083
Redmond is far superior.

17
00:00:51,750 --> 00:00:52,500
- Exactly.

18
00:00:53,208 --> 00:00:56,625
Under Redmond, House Carter
will only grow stronger.

19
00:00:58,250 --> 00:00:58,625
Stronger?

20
00:00:59,750 --> 00:01:02,750
This family will be destroyed in less than three years.

21
00:01:02,750 --> 00:01:04,583
You're the eldest
son of House Carter,

22
00:01:05,125 --> 00:01:06,791
and you dare curse your own family?!

23
00:01:06,791 --> 00:01:08,083
I’m only speaking the truth.

24
00:01:09,791 --> 00:01:13,125
My lord, I propose
banishing Severin from the family.

25
00:01:13,375 --> 00:01:15,250
A public whipping, then exile.

26
00:01:15,750 --> 00:01:19,000
This shows everyone that family honor cannot be questioned.

27
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,625
- Disgraceful.

28
00:01:22,750 --> 00:01:24,375
You’re the ones plotting in the shadows

29
00:01:24,375 --> 00:01:26,458
while pretending to be honorable.

30
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:28,083
Do any of you
dare swear on your

31
00:01:28,083 --> 00:01:30,083
lives that this
vote is truly fair?

32
00:01:32,250 --> 00:01:34,916
You think being the
“eldest” gives you the right?

33
00:01:35,750 --> 00:01:38,416
A worthless miner like
you doesn’t deserve it!

34
00:01:39,708 --> 00:01:42,083
My lord,please cast
him out of the family!

35
00:01:42,583 --> 00:01:51,083
Please cast him out of the family!

36
00:01:54,208 --> 00:01:55,291
I have great news.

37
00:01:57,291 --> 00:01:59,791
Steward Jeyn of the Sovereign Sanctum
has promised me

38
00:02:00,125 --> 00:02:02,666
he will help raise House Carter to stand alongside

39
00:02:02,666 --> 00:02:04,291
the Four Great Families of Golantis.

40
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,625
Lord Redmond will save us.

41
00:02:07,375 --> 00:02:08,625
The Sovereign Sanctum will

42
00:02:08,625 --> 00:02:09,708
not support House Carter.

43
00:02:09,750 --> 00:02:10,458
You sound so sure.

44
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:12,416
What, you think you
control the entire Sovereign Sanctum?

45
00:02:13,750 --> 00:02:14,500
For once you’re right.

46
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:16,333
I do.
